Note: Palindromes are words that read the same backwards as forwards, like "mom", "dad", "racecar", and so on. This script checks for palindromic substrings, so a word like "pythonyhtyp" (which itself is not a palindrome but contains "yhty", which is) would also be considered a match."}]

